From 3c5a630afc70ff14615d878fcb973ed8a2415c34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andras Lasso <lasso@queensu.ca>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:22:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] BUG: Rename vtkMRMLFileIOManager Register and Unregister
 methods

vtkMRMLFileIOManager::Register(vtkMRMLFileIOHandler*) hid
vtkObjectBase::Register(vtkObjectBase*) in C++, but in Python
fileIOManager.Register(handler) called vtkObjectBase::Register: the handler
was not registered, and the reference count of the manager was incremented
(leaking the manager), without any error or warning.

The methods are renamed to RegisterHandler and UnregisterHandler
(Unregister is renamed for consistency).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
